'''Psychocat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 6.5 Update|Version 6.5]] improves his health, attack rate and movement speed. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.3 Update|Version 8.3]].

