==Trivia==
*Psychocat's hairstyle looks nearly identical to that of Koichi "Babel II" Yamano from [[wikipedia:Babel II|''Babel II'']], the descendant of an alien who inherits his superhuman intellect and powers.
**Psychocat's hairstyle and outfit both also resemble the eponymous character of the manga [[wikipedia:Locke the Superman|''Locke the Superman'']], an extraterrestrial with a variety of psychic powers.
*Psychocat's spoon is a reference to [[wikipedia:Spoon bending|spoon bending]], a common theme in magic tricks.
*Neo Psychocat's description is a reference to the battle between [[wikia:dragonball:Gotenks|Gotenks]] and [[wikia:dragonball:Super Buu|Super Buu]] in the [[wikia:dragonball:Hyperbolic Time Chamber|Hyperbolic Time Chamber]], in the saga ''Dragon Ball Z''. His appearance is basically a [[wikia:dragonball:Super Saiyan|Super Saiyan]].
*Corrupted Psychocat is a reference to Soldier Blue from [[wikipedia:Toward the Terra|''Toward the Terra'']], who has a fairly similar getup including hearing aids and destroyed himself with his own psionic power.
*When counting all three of his forms, Psychocat has the most [[Pop Culture References]] of any [[Cat Units|Cat Unit]] and is in second place for the most references of any character overall, with [[Bears Be Back]] in first place.

